+	/**
+	 * {@code WandOfIllusionWeapon#onMorphDamageDealt} - the melee extras each morph
+	 * applies to whatever the disguised player hits.
+	 *
+	 * @return {@code true} when the hit must be cancelled entirely (bat, horse and
